; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Photo</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.8233%; height: 84px;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">A passport-sized colored photo.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Background should be white or light-colored.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 84px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 35.1767%; height: 84px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Signature</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.8233%; height: 84px;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Clear signature on white paper using a black or blue pen.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 84px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 35.1767%; height: 84px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Educational Certificates</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.8233%; height: 84px;\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">A bachelor\u2019s degree from a recognized university.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Read the Notification For More Details\u00a0</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 59px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 35.1767%; height: 59px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Caste Certificate</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.8233%; height: 59px;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For reserved category candidates.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 35.1767%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Aadhaar Card For Id Proof</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.8233%; height: 25px;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Aadhaar card, Voter ID, or any other government-issued ID.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 35.1767%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Domicile Certificate</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.8233%; height: 25px;\">